claim.claim-text:
a cam driver that is rotatable about a longitudinal axis of the puncture mechanism;
a first cam defined by the cam driver;
a second cam defined by the cam driver;
a first cam follower associated with the first cam; and
a second cam follower associated with the second cam;
the first cam configured to cause the first cam follower to move axially along the longitudinal axis of the puncture mechanism, the second cam configured to cause the second cam follower to move along a linear path transverse to the longitudinal axis of the puncture mechanism, wherein the first cam and second cam are positionally fixed relative to one another on the cam driver.

a first cam;
a first cam follower associated with the first cam and configured to move in an axial direction in response to rotation of the first cam to cause relative axial movement between an anvil and a beverage pod;
a second cam; and
a second cam follower associated with the second cam and configured to move in a lateral direction in response to rotation of the second cam to cause engagement between a sliding lock and a beverage pod.
